B.rM=new A.bs(B.rS,["Soko Vibe \u2014 Nunua na Uza Bidhaa Tanzania","Jinsi Inavyofanya Kazi","Usalama","Kwa Wauzaji","Maswali","Anza Kuuza","Fungua menyu","Funga menyu","Lugha","Soko la Tanzania \xb7 Malipo ya escrow","Nunua kwa uhakika.","Uza kwa ujasiri.","Soko Vibe ni soko la Tanzania la kununua na kuuza bidhaa kwa urahisi, huku malipo yakilindwa kwa escrow mpaka uthibitishe kupokea bidhaa yako.","Anza Kununua","Anza Kuuza","Angalia huduma","Tafuta simu, viatu, samani\u2026","Escrow inalinda malipo","Usafirishaji nchi nzima","Imetengenezwa kwa wanunuzi na wauzaji wa Tanzania.","Aliyehakikiwa","Usafirishaji","Kwa nini Soko Vibe?","Ununuzi unaanza kwa kuamini.","Kila hatua ya muamala imejengwa kukulinda \u2014 kuanzia unapoona bidhaa hadi unapoipokea.","Escrow inalinda pesa","Fedha zinashikiliwa na ClickPesa hadi uthibitishe kupokea bidhaa. Mgogoro ukitokea, timu inashughulikia.","Wauzaji waliohakikiwa","Wauzaji huthibitisha utambulisho (KYC) kabla ya kuuza.","Mazungumzo salama","Ongea na muuzaji ndani ya app kabla ya kuamua \u2014 maswali, picha na majadiliano ya bei.","Mobile money","Lipa kwa M-Pesa, Tigo Pesa, Airtel Money, HaloPesa au EzyPesa.","Uthibitisho wa OTP","Unathibitisha kupokea kwa OTP \u2014 ndipo muuzaji analipwa.","Utafutaji wa AI","Tafuta kwa kuandika au kwa sauti; msaidizi anakusaidia kupata unachohitaji.","Fedha zako hazitoki mpaka upokee.","Huu ndio mzunguko wa kila malipo \u2014 wazi, unaofuatiliwa, na salama kwa pande zote mbili.","Mnunuzi analipa","Escrow inashikilia","Muuzaji anatuma","Mnunuzi anapokea","Mnunuzi anathibitisha","Muuzaji analipwa","Kwa wanunuzi","Kila kitu unachohitaji kununua kwa amani.","Tafuta na linganisha bidhaa","Ongea na muuzaji moja kwa moja","Lipa kwa usalama kupitia escrow","Fuatilia oda yako","Thibitisha kupokea kwa OTP","Kwa wauzaji","Duka lako, dashboard yenye nguvu.","Weka bidhaa bure, simamia oda, ongea na wateja na ukuze mauzo.","Orodha za bidhaa bila gharama","Takwimu za mauzo kwa wakati","Boost bidhaa kwa bei nafuu","Uthibitisho wa muuzaji (KYC)","Usimamizi wa oda na pochi","Mfano wa takwimu","J1","J2","J3","J4","J5","J6","J7","Teknolojia","Tafuta unachotaka kwa njia rahisi.","Andika kama unavyoongea \u2014 au bonyeza kipaza sauti.","samani za kisasa","Mfano wa onesho","Nakupendekeza kategoria zifuatazo:","Tafuta kwa sauti","Usafirishaji","Unaona kila hatua ya kifurushi chako.","Oda imewekwa","Malipo yanaingia escrow mara moja.","Muuzaji anaandaa","Bidhaa inafungwa na kukabidhiwa msafirishaji.","Njiani","Unafuatilia usafirishaji nchi nzima.","Inakaribia","Unajulishwa kifurushi kinapowasili.","Imepokelewa","Unathibitisha kwa OTP \u2014 muuzaji analipwa.","Ukuaji wa muuzaji","Unataka bidhaa yako ionekane zaidi?","Kuweka orodha ni bure kila wakati. Unalipa tu unapochagua kupandisha.","Mwonekano wa haraka","Wiki nzima ya mwonekano","Ufikiaji mkubwa, mwezi mzima","kwa orodha moja","siku 3","siku 7","siku 30","Maarufu","Pandisha kwenye app","Bei zote ni shilingi za Tanzania. Boost unafanya ndani ya app.","Usalama","Tulivu, wazi, salama.","Escrow na ClickPesa","Fedha zinashikiliwa hadi ununuzi uthibitike.","KYC ya wauzaji","Utambulisho unahakikiwa kabla ya kuuza.","Mchakato wa malalamiko","Mgogoro ukitokea kuna njia rasmi ya kutatua.","Faragha ya data","Tunafuata Sheria ya Ulinzi wa Data ya Tanzania, 2022.","App","Soko lote mfukoni mwako.","App ya Android inapatikana sasa kupitia WhatsApp. Tutumie ujumbe tukupatie link rasmi.","Pata Soko Vibe","Google Play \u2014 Inapatikana hivi karibuni","Maswali","Maswali yanayoulizwa mara kwa mara","Je, kuweka bidhaa ni bure?","Ndiyo. Kufungua orodha haina gharama. Unalipa tu unapochagua ku-boost.","Fedha zangu zinalindwaje?","Malipo yanaingia escrow kupitia ClickPesa na yanatolewa kwa muuzaji tu baada ya wewe kuthibitisha kupokea.","Naweza kuzungumza na muuzaji?","Ndiyo \u2014 kila orodha ina mazungumzo ya ndani ya app kabla ya kununua.","Usafirishaji unafanyaje kazi?","Wauzaji hupanga usafirishaji nchi nzima; unathibitisha kupokea kwa OTP.","Kuna ada gani?","Ada ya jukwaa ya 3.5% kwa mnunuzi wakati wa ununuzi. Muuzaji anapokea bei kamili. Hakuna ada ya orodha.","Ninawezaje kupata app?","Tutumie ujumbe WhatsApp +255 693 273 241 na tutakupatia link rasmi ya Android.","Karibu kwenye soko linalofuata la Tanzania.","Nunua kwa uhakika. Uza kwa ujasiri.","Anza na Soko Vibe","Soko la Tanzania la kununua na kuuza kwa usalama.","Soko Vibe","Jinsi Inavyofanya Kazi","Usalama","Ada","Maswali","Kwa Wauzaji","Anza Kuuza","Zana za Muuzaji","Boost","Uthibitisho","Sheria","Privacy","Terms","Security","Mawasiliano","Haki zote zimehifadhiwa."],t.li)
B.Jq=new A.bs(B.rS,["Soko Vibe \u2014 Buy and Sell Products in Tanzania","How It Works","Security","For Sellers","FAQ","Start Selling","Open menu","Close menu","Language","Tanzanian market \xb7 Escrow payments","Buy with confidence.","Sell with courage.","Soko Vibe is the Tanzanian market for buying and selling products with ease, while payments stay protected in escrow until you confirm receipt.","Start Buying","Start Selling","Explore services","Search phones, shoes, furniture\u2026","Escrow protects payment","Nationwide delivery","Built for Tanzanian buyers and sellers.","Verified","Delivery","Why Soko Vibe?","Buying starts with trust.","Every step of the transaction is built to protect you \u2014 from discovery to doorstep.","Escrow-protected money","Funds are held by ClickPesa until you confirm receipt. If a dispute arises, the team steps in.","Verified sellers","Sellers verify identity (KYC) before selling.","Secure chat","Talk to the seller in-app before deciding \u2014 questions, photos, price talk.","Mobile money","Pay with M-Pesa, Tigo Pesa, Airtel Money, HaloPesa or EzyPesa.","OTP confirmation","You confirm receipt with an OTP \u2014 only then is the seller paid.","AI search","Search by typing or voice; the assistant helps you find what you need.","Your money never moves until you receive.","This is the journey of every payment \u2014 open, trackable, and safe for both sides.","Buyer pays","Escrow holds","Seller ships","Buyer receives","Buyer confirms","Seller is paid","For buyers","Everything you need to buy in peace.","Find and compare products","Chat directly with sellers","Pay securely via escrow","Track your order","Confirm delivery with OTP","For sellers","Your shop, a powerful dashboard.","List for free, manage orders, talk to customers and grow sales.","Free product listings","Real-time sales stats","Affordable product boosts","Seller verification (KYC)","Orders and wallet management","Sample stats","W1","W2","W3","W4","W5","W6","W7","Technology","Find what you want, the easy way.","Write like you speak \u2014 or tap the microphone.","modern furniture","Demo illustration","I suggest these categories:","Voice search","Delivery","See every step of your parcel.","Order placed","Payment enters escrow immediately.","Seller prepares","The product is packed and handed to the courier.","In transit","You follow delivery across the country.","Arriving","You are notified as the parcel arrives.","Delivered","You confirm with OTP \u2014 the seller is paid.","Seller growth","Want your product seen more?","Listing is always free. You only pay when you choose to boost.","Quick visibility","A full week of visibility","Maximum reach, all month","per listing","3 days","7 days","30 days","Popular","Boost in the app","All prices are Tanzanian shillings. Boosting happens inside the app.","Security","Calm, open, secure.","Escrow & ClickPesa","Funds are held until the purchase is confirmed.","Seller KYC","Identity is verified before selling.","Complaints process","If a dispute arises there is a formal resolution path.","Data privacy","We follow the Tanzania Data Protection Act, 2022.","App","The whole market in your pocket.","The Android app is available now via WhatsApp. Message us and we will send the official link.","Get Soko Vibe","Google Play \u2014 Coming soon","FAQ","Frequently asked questions","Is listing products free?","Yes. Opening a listing costs nothing. You only pay when you choose to boost.","How is my money protected?","Payments enter escrow via ClickPesa and reach the seller only after you confirm receipt.","Can I talk to the seller?","Yes \u2014 every listing has in-app chat before you buy.","How does delivery work?","Sellers arrange nationwide delivery; you confirm receipt with OTP.","What fees exist?","A 3.5% platform fee for the buyer at checkout. The seller receives the full price. No listing fees.","How do I get the app?","Message us on WhatsApp at +255 693 273 241 for the official Android link.","Welcome to the next Tanzanian market.","Buy with confidence. Sell with courage.","Start with Soko Vibe","The Tanzanian market for safe buying and selling.","Soko Vibe","How It Works","Security","Fees","FAQ","For Sellers","Start Selling","Seller Tools","Boost","Verification","Legal","Privacy","Terms","Security","Contact","All rights reserved."],t.li)
